{"title":"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1a\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1a</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_1b\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1b</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Cheese)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Cheese)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Of the students attending a school party, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/7/fd7edd3842c40dbc1e54e522917a6e07b43c92e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of the students are girls, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/e/f4e4e5c6d549ce47918b94180cad5c1644d9ea88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of the students like to dance. After these students are joined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> more boy students, all of whom like to dance, the party is now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/4/c749c3a114f136edf0c3fce127424bcf345ce0eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$58\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> girls. How many students now at the party like to dance?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1a\">Solution 1a</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1a\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Say that there were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/6/ce6582d1a31d1fd6bdab19f0d332c8d93adb9c66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3k$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> girls and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/e/b8ea7ee8a282949fd853a01537ec7a2b55e56f75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2k$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> boys at the party originally. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/e/b8ea7ee8a282949fd853a01537ec7a2b55e56f75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2k$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> like to dance. Then, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/6/ce6582d1a31d1fd6bdab19f0d332c8d93adb9c66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3k$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> girls and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/e/9ce1479cd95ceb4b0698187035dcf70ec00313d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2k + 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" /> boys, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/e/9ce1479cd95ceb4b0698187035dcf70ec00313d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2k + 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" /> like to dance.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/7/057b5674f0975593f9bd89727a88ec86d3172657.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{3k}{5k + 20} = \\dfrac{29}{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"108\" height=\"39\" />, solving gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/7/cf72b13b74cd77d08cdd0ef3d08df93f34f9291d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 116$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />. Thus, the number of people that like to dance is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/7/bb795f693928feabd3eeea921c86e928a4841a88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2k + 20 = \\boxed{252}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"123\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1b\">Solution 1b</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1b\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> be the original total. Then, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/8/868780f12ac813827277739bdbaf6cbc224ef1b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3T}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"28\" height=\"39\" /> girls. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/5/dc5fc8647f7e58f7231b4c8226659afa2558eec7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{3T}{5}}{T+20}=\\frac{29}{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"106\" height=\"44\" />. Solving, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/9/6f9b93229fdd4595ed689ff9f2a59ed9a7941d71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T=580$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f715c6b79e639dea25c0e9a512ff19019f1fa7ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.4\\cdot580+20=\\boxed{252}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"169\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let the number of girls be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />. Let the number of total people originally be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/a/d5a14c48c11e289eee3b72e16ae4c1066ed8aa1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{g}{t}=\\frac{3}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"49\" height=\"37\" /> from the problem.\n</p><p>We also know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/b/c9b89f14d3e228bc229f1d39c5583411ad764eb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{g}{t+20}=\\frac{29}{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"95\" height=\"39\" /> from the problem.\n</p><p>We now have a system and we can solve.\n</p><p>The first equation becomes:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/9/9e98e92f4d84e238e1db88fa7d233916c6e46d3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3t=5g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>The second equation becomes: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fdd83bdc0c54c8af77d9ffa52b8a8426198164f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50g=29t+580$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"125\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Now we can sub in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/9/8d9e464e7c58236724d058cbcc76cdab5c85cd16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30t=50g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"16\" /> by multiplying the first equation by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. We can plug this into our second equation.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/5/98504629328115caa3bed5af454598e332454181.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30t=29t+580$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"122\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/7/497e1ce2f158dfc35a15c39588d7ebc3faca31c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=580$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>We know that there were originally <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/5/755b503a01bef7367e111135d2934ea1af816cbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$580$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> people. Of those, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/1/c01214b01ff992d095b4d58ebea4949a6bc263d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{5}*580=232$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"108\" height=\"37\" /> like to dance.\n</p><p>We also know that with these people, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> boys joined, all of whom like to dance. We just simply need to add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/1/941553a759cdd4b6ee3c0babde3b097ada90fe0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$232+20=\\boxed{252}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"131\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> denote the total number of people at the party. Then, because we know the proportions of boys to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> both before and after 20 boys arrived, we can create the following equation:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/b/8ebeb9d737c0024cd5d3a57de641b91546c1fff7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0.4p+20 = 0.42(p+20)\\]\" width=\"190\" height=\"18\" />\nSolving for p gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/f/0afec491d6eabe204d69d676fd398f664c1e7f4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=580$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />, so the solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/1/6d1477282bfcaa89e5f7eb6c7a9b6c05ed502ba0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.4p+20 = \\boxed{252}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"136\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Cheese.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Cheese)\">Solution 4 (Cheese)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Cheese)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume all the boys like to dance and none of the girls like to dance. We then proceed like the previous solutions.\n</p><p>~Arcticturn\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I\" title=\"2008 AIME I\">2008 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2008\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2008 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017185753\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.067 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 276/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1756/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 115/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6655/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   15.252      1 -total\n 58.10%    8.861      1 Template:AIME_box\n 39.46%    6.018      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6615:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017185753 and revision id 288561. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}